        "notes": "\"Toy Scrappers\" is a thrilling chase-based horror game where some players takes on the role of a killer attempting to capture other players. The game includes:\r\n\r\nHorror Elements: Jump scares, dark environments, and unexpected events designed to create a tense atmosphere.\r\n\r\nViolence: The killer performs attack animations on toy characters. These animations involve mild violence but do not include blood or excessive gore.\r\n\r\nPsychological Tension: Players may experience heightened tension due to the thrill of escaping or being pursued.\r\n\r\nThe game does not include sexual content, sexual violence, drug use, alcohol, or self-harm. However, it may not be suitable for players sensitive to intense horror or suspenseful themes."
    },
